			"text": "Typical Stats from the reviewed package: ST 22, DX 13, IQ 7, HT 11, HP 22, WILL 10, PER 10, FP 11, SPEED 6, MOVE 10, DODGE 10, DR 2. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
